{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OrwrIwWFCd1792669917.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港失業率稍為上升。</p><p></p><p>7月至9月經季節性調整的失業率升至百分之3.9，較6月至8月及市場預期高0.1個百分點。失業人數增加約1,100人，大約15.5萬人無工開。</p><p></p><p>就業不足率百分之2，較6月至8月高0.1個百分點。</p><p></p><p>勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡表示，本港經濟持續擴張，營商氣氛改善，以及訪港旅客人次繼續增長，預期會為整體就業情況提供支持。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:02.369555+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.726646+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:34.807376+00:00","content_hash":"707dd6a77c16f93fdcf092894e64d4e4a041af6691f1b5769fcdf071b286a9fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:02.369555+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}